        "@value": "Of the amounts appropriated under section 9903(a) of title 42 for each fiscal year, the Secretary shall reserve 1 1/2 percent for activities authorized in sections 9913 through 9918 of title 42, of which not less than 1/2 of the amount reserved under paragraph (2) shall be distributed directly to eligible entities, organizations, or associations described in section 9913(c)(2) of title 42 for the purpose of carrying out activities described in section 9913(c) of title 42.",
        "@language": "en"
      },
      "rkaf:assertionPolarity": "rkaf:affirmed"
