        "@value": "Of the amounts appropriated under section 9903(a) of title 42 for each fiscal year, of the 1 1/2 percent reserved under paragraph (2) for activities authorized in sections 9913 through 9918, 1/2 of the remainder of the amount reserved shall be used by the Secretary to carry out evaluation and to assist States in carrying out corrective action activities and monitoring (to correct programmatic deficiencies of eligible entities), as described in sections 9914(c) and 9913 of title 42.",
        "@language": "en"
      },
      "rkaf:assertionPolarity": "rkaf:affirmed"
