      },
      "skos:definition": {
        "en": "The term \"charity tax credit\" means a nonrefundable credit against State income tax (or, in the case of a State that does not impose an income tax, a comparable benefit) that is allowable for contributions, in cash or in kind, to qualified charities."
      },
