lified charities at least 90 percent of the gifts and grants the organization receives that are designated for such qualified charities; and\",\"(cc) that meets the requirements of clause (vi).\"]}],\"effective_periods\":[],\"end\":31059,\"evidence\":[{\"end\":30571,\"field\":\"summary\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3A26bf1a2bb4a435dfac4c95beee0b11ea78bab22ac670bb65754c9e2393e34023:30543:30571:sha256-65df4a9aabeb4c860dae071e837f18ee26f640d851b6787492562500704883a8\",\"quote\":\"(II) Collection organization\",\"start\":30543},{\"end\":30729,\"field\":\"summary\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3A26bf1a2bb4a435dfac4c95beee0b11ea78bab22ac670bb65754c9e2393e34023:30572:30729:sha256-fb9b614999ea802de07ce07a9dc68c93659c6943db03ce614e7421f152eb415a\",\"quote\":\"The term “collection organization” means an organization described in section 501(c)(3) of such title and exempt from tax under section 501(a) of such title—\",\"start\":30572},{\"end\":31059,\"field\":\"summary\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3A26bf1a2bb4a435dfac4c95beee0b11ea78bab22ac670bb65754c9e2393e34023:30731:31059:sha256-097e29daffcb5df56a869d30c3f69cd594b9569243356f23ad1bcb861ac04b1e\",\"quote\":\"(aa) that solicits and collects gifts and grants that, by agreement, are distributed to qualified charities;\\n\\n(bb) that distributes to qualified charities at least 90 percent of the gifts and grants the organization receives that are designated for such qualified charities; and\\n\\n(cc) that meets the requirements of clause (vi).\",\"start\":30731},{\"end\":29266,\"field\":\"scope_text:0\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3A26bf1a2bb4a435dfac4c95beee0b11ea78bab22ac670bb65754c9e2393e34023:29241:29266:sha256-aea566b0f29d0189db01116b9bd6a1dbb8292c28864bce72d66471186cd8b70d\",\"quote\":\"(3) De