od, shelter, education, substance abuse prevention or treatment, job training, or other) of services that constitute predominant activities of the organization.\",\"start\":33567}],\"id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:revision:0e5048740f218e4c1a45c01f4989a443e772292d1466de4fe600d204e406c10d\",\"jurisdiction\":\"\",\"jurisdiction_quote\":\"\",\"kind\":\"statement\",\"logic_text\":\"\",\"meaning_assertion_id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:8a0b6409c9140c4cfb15bc419350cd11a2072f17ac25858dd80026b1a1123180\",\"modality\":\"not_stated\",\"modality_quote\":\"\",\"object\":\"\",\"occurrence_id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:occurrence:8ab6dad52b0aad31eb90624943fbdc2a441ee9179d134b56b627d57d0f186c6a\",\"origin\":\"aiSuggested\",\"quote\":\"(v) Reporting requirement The information required to be furnished under this clause about an organization is—\\n\\n(I) the percentages determined by dividing the following categories of the organization’s expenses for the year by the total expenses of the organization for the year: expenses for direct services, management expenses, general expenses, fundraising expenses, and payments to affiliates; and\\n\\n(II) the category or categories (including food, shelter, education, substance abuse prevention or treatment, job training, or other) of services that constitute predominant activities of the organization.\",\"references\":[\"clause (v)\"],\"relation\":\"none\",\"rule_id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:rule:adaa2eb78e991049481843818bd1ce10aed875678bc206d480522c96ca6134e3\",\"scope_quotes\":[],\"scope_text\":\"\",\"section_id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:section:065d5bd1b1fd12e07012730aaa12714e330211d213042d09aad361bcfa67ebfa\",\"start\":33455,\"summary\":\"The information required to be furnished under clause (v) about an organization is: (I) the percentages determined by dividing the following categories of the organization's expenses for the year by the total expenses of the organization for the year: expenses for direct services, management expenses, general expenses, fundraising expenses, and payments to affiliates; and (II) the category or categories (including food, shelter, education, substance abuse prevention or treatment, job training, or other) of services that constitute predominant activities of the organization.\",\"target_ids\":[],\"term_refs\":[],\"typed_values\":[]}",
