        "@value": "{\"actor\":\"the entity\",\"kind\":\"requirement\",\"modality\":\"must\",\"scope_text\":\"In order for a private, nonprofit entity to be considered to be an eligible entity for purposes of section 9902(1) of this title\",\"summary\":\"In order for a private, nonprofit entity to be considered to be an eligible entity for purposes of section 9902(1) of title 42, the entity shall administer the community services block grant program through a tripartite board described in 42 U.S.C. 9910(a)(2) that fully participates in the development, planning, implementation, and evaluation of the program to serve low-income communities.\"}",
