          "@type": "oa:TextQuoteSelector",
          "oa:exact": "(1) receives a request from the governing body of an Indian tribe or tribal organization within the State that assistance under this chapter be made directly to such tribe or organization; and\n\n(2) determines that the members of such tribe or tribal organization would be better served by means of grants made directly to provide benefits under this chapter,"
