1) Indian tribe; tribal organization\",\"start\":60752},{\"end\":61067,\"field\":\"summary\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3A26bf1a2bb4a435dfac4c95beee0b11ea78bab22ac670bb65754c9e2393e34023:60791:61067:sha256-44911d50b33b7144a8e3e781e7010c65b5a5f2ed04e910a96c078ba42a4a4671\",\"quote\":\"The terms “Indian tribe” and “tribal organization” mean a tribe, band, or other organized group recognized in the State in which the tribe, band, or group resides, or considered by the Secretary of the Interior, to be an Indian tribe or an Indian organization for any purpose.\",\"start\":60791},{\"end\":60733,\"field\":\"scope_text:0\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3A26bf1a2bb4a435dfac4c95beee0b11ea78bab22ac670bb65754c9e2393e34023:60718:60733:sha256-927ec91cb943ae482f4d0b05acd482472c6345d68b24d6389fab829eaa57e64c\",\"quote\":\"(e) Definitions\",\"start\":60718},{\"end\":60750,\"field\":\"scope_text:0\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3A26bf1a2bb4a435dfac4c95beee0b11ea78bab22ac670bb65754c9e2393e34023:60734:60750:sha256-681c8ead56e5a735c3fc2155e1be8347f783062d629efe3c95a4164e80a7f14c\",\"quote\":\"In this section:\",\"start\":60734},{\"end\":60789,\"field\":\"defined_terms:0\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3A26bf1a2bb4a435dfac4c95beee0b11ea78bab22ac670bb65754c9e2393e34023:60752:60789:sha256-aaccbd05f6a5c5789f143827ffb1d349a971215a8564e59b99d6c97b82b7f166\",\"quote\":\"(1) Indian tribe; tribal organization\",\"start\":60752},{\"end\":61067,\"field\":\"defined_terms:0\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3A26bf1a2bb4a435dfac4c95beee0b11ea78bab22ac670bb65754c9e2393e34023:60791:61067:sha256-44911d50b33b7144a8e3e781e7010c65b5a5f2ed04e910a96c078ba42a4a4671\",\"quote\":\"The terms “Indian tribe” and “tribal organization” mean a tribe, band, or other organized group recognized in the State in which the tribe, band, or group resides, or considered by the Secretary of the Interior, to be an Indian tribe or an Indian organization for any purpose.\",\"start\":60791},{\"end\":60789,\"field\":\"defined_terms:0:source:0\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3A26bf1a2bb4a435dfac4c95beee0b11ea78bab22ac670bb65754c9e2393e34023:60752:60789:sha256-aaccbd05f6a5c5789f143827ffb1d349a971215a8564e59b99d6c97b82b7f166\",\"quote\":\"(1) Indian tribe; tribal organization\",\"start\":60752},{\"end\":61067,\"field\":\"defined_terms:0:source:1\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3A26bf1a2bb4a435dfac4c95beee0b11ea78bab22ac670bb65754c9e2393e34023:60791:61067:sha256-44911d50b33b7144a8e3e781e7010c65b5a5f2ed04e910a96c078ba42a4a4671\",\"quote\":\"The terms “Indian tribe” and “tribal organization” mean a tribe, band, or other organized group recognized in the State in which the tribe, band, or group resides, or considered by the Secretary of the Interior, to be an Indian tribe or an Indian organization for any purpose.\",\"start\":60791}],\"id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:revision:46bce2aec01dba6563aa3f681a2d51f181b33290b047772e572a79f49b76e1aa\",\"jurisdiction\":\"\",\"jurisdiction_quote\":\"\",\"kind\":\"definition\",\"logic_text\":\"\",\"meaning_assertion_id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:7651b26a79922267823bee678ac7d1c93ce3fade49627ebf20566ea984c21a4e\",\"modality\":\"not_stated\",\"modality_quote\":\"\",\"object\":\"\",\"occurrence_id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:occurrence:27ecbfba43940f737f223ef218dfc72c9f499d0a00761546bb80aa63ec65a42e\",\"origin\":\"aiSuggested\",\"quote\":\"(1) Indian tribe; tribal organization\\n\\nThe terms “Indian tribe” and “tribal organization” mean a tribe, band, or other organized group recognized in the State in which the tribe, band, or