      "rkaf:assertsValue": {
        "@value": "The results of the evaluations conducted under 42 U.S.C. 9914(c) shall be submitted annually to the Chairperson of the Committee on Education and the Workforce of the House of Representatives and the Chairperson of the Committee on Labor and Human Resources of the Senate (now the Committee on Health, Education, Labor, and Pensions of the Senate) as part of the report submitted by the Secretary in accordance with section 9917(b)(2) of title 42.",
