        "@value": "Of the amount appropriated for a fiscal year to carry out section 9922 (but not to exceed $6,000,000), the Secretary must allot 60 percent of such amount (not to exceed $3,600,000) for grants to eligible agencies for statewide programs in each State in an amount that bears the same ratio to such portion as the low-income and unemployed population of such State bears to the low-income and unemployed population of all the States.",
