        "@value": "Each nonprofit organization participating in a project conducted under 42 U.S.C. 9926 shall provide assurances in its agreement with the Secretary that it has or will have a cooperative relationship with the agency responsible for administering the State program funded under part A of title IV of the Social Security Act [42 U.S.C. 601 et seq.] in the area served by the project.",
        "@language": "en"
      },
      "rkaf:assertionPolarity": "rkaf:affirmed"
